        {
          "section": "Associate of Science",
          "text": "The science sequences are:",
          "codes": []
        },
        {
          "section": "Associate of Science",
          "text": "BIO 133** and BIO 134**; BIO 142** and BIO 143**; CHM 111, CHM 116** and CHM 112, CHM 117**; CHM 110, CHM 115**, CHM 114,CHM 118**; PHY 111, PHY 112**, PHY 113 , PHY 114**; PHY 220, PHY 221**, PHY 222, PHY 223**, PHY 224, PHY 225**; CSC 144 and CSC 145; CSC 141 and CSC 171.",
          "codes": [
            "BIO 133",
            "CHM 117",
            "CHM 110",
            "PHY 112",
            "PHY 113",
            "PHY 114",
            "CSC 171"
          ]
        },
        {
          "section": "Associate of Science",
          "text": "Note that a student cannot earn credit for this degree from both CHM sequences, from both PHY sequences, or from both CSC sequences. Courses with a laboratory component are indicated with **.",
          "codes": []
